f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":176809603,"discussion_id":"59f904b4c0b2036ed51e300addc50f3fe530c304","body":"#### 变更摘要\n\n此 PR 针对 `math/polar/op_kernel/arch35/polar_simt.h` 中的 Polar 算子 SIMT 内核，将大量索引、步长和元素计数相关变量从 `int32_t` 升级为 `int64_t`，以解决当张量总元素数或维度累积索引超出 int32 表示范围（约 21 亿）时发生的溢出与精度丢失问题。\n\n**主要改动**\n\n- **`PolarStridePara` 结构体成员类型变更**：将 `ms`、`absS`、`angleS`、`yS` 四个步长数组的元素类型从 `int32_t` 改为 `int64_t`，确保大张量的 stride 值不会溢出。\n- **类成员变量类型变更**：将 `totalElements_`、`elementsPerCore_`、`coreNum_`、`formerCore_`、`dimNum_` 从 `int32_t` 改为 `int64_t`，保障超大张量场景下元素计数与维度数的正确表示。\n- **`Process()` 函数中的局部变量类型变更**：将 `startIdx`、`count` 等核心分片计算变量从 `int32_t` 升级为 `int64_t`，避免分片起始索引溢出。\n- **`SimtPolarCompute` 核函数中的变量类型变更**：将函数参数（`startIdx`、`count`、`dimNum`）以及循环内的 `idx`、`step`、`i`、`v`、`absBase`、`angleBase`、`yBase`、`vv`、`d`、`c` 等全部索引/偏移计算变量从 `int32_t` 改为 `int64_t`，保证 SIMT 线程内多维度地址计算全程使用 64 位精度。\n\n","created_at":"2026-06-24T00:47:33+08:00","updated_at":"2026-06-24T00:47:33+08:00","user":{"id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","login":"atomgit-bot","object_id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","name":"atomgit-bot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/fb/bb/88f9bbb284ce2dc057d85551b1bbe66acb35305ce59007d28029609b5e4b9652.png?time=1777513981052","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/atomgit-bot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":176809899,"discussion_id":"f3eb6d0218a61816bfed30ca111dca557f03e48d","body":"#### 代码审查\n\n✅ 未发现问题\n\n","created_at":"2026-06-24T00:55:37+08:00","updated_at":"2026-06-24T00:55:37+08:00","user":{"id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","login":"atomgit-bot","object_id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","name":"atomgit-bot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/fb/bb/88f9bbb284ce2dc057d85551b1bbe66acb35305ce59007d28029609b5e4b9652.png?time=1777513981052","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/atomgit-bot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":176836452,"discussion_id":"bf2578ba0407e